As a side effect, running the proxy requires nodejs v14 now. I have also [included a package-lock.json file](https://github.com/galaxyproject/gx-it-proxy/commit/017981402ceff14ee71e4ad50bbfba981adc4bc4) and [version specifiers for `axios`, `axios-retry`, `chai` and `mocha`](https://github.com/galaxyproject/gx-it-proxy/commit/8d3ee65f8adae84a28505a2ff92e93b891e0f879).

